      "source": [
        "## 7. Deep learning models\n",
        "- **MLP:** flattened window -> Dense 256 -> 128 -> 16.\n",
        "- **LSTM / GRU:** two stacked recurrent layers (96, 48 units) -> Dense 64 -> 16.\n",
        "- Targets are standardised residuals over persistence; MSE loss; Adam; early stopping on **validation** loss.\n",
        "- The architecture is chosen on the **validation** set (never the test set)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 9,
      "id": "873eb45f",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 496
        },
        "id": "873eb45f",
        "outputId": "16d4da9f-fd7e-4035-89ab-2d676c75bb4c"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "  MLP seed 0: 48 epochs, best val loss 0.5479 (26s)\n",
            "  LSTM seed 0: 16 epochs, best val loss 0.5828 (18s)\n",
            "  GRU seed 0: 19 epochs, best val loss 0.5626 (18s)\n",
            "Validation 24 h track error (km): {'MLP': 150.2, 'LSTM': 153.9, 'GRU': 152.1} -> chosen architecture: MLP\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "output_type": "display_data",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": [
