        "- **Rapid intensification (RI):** wind rises by 30 kt or more in 24 h. Probability = fraction of ensemble members predicting it.\n",
        "- **Landfall approach:** storm currently >100 km from land and within 100 km of land 24 h later."
      ]
    },
